<title>USA: Dow dips, other U.S. stocks fairly steady at open.</title>
<headline>Dow dips, other U.S. stocks fairly steady at open.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. stocks opened steady to lower on Wednesday, with the Dow industrials facing some follow-through pressure after a late wave of sales on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial Average was down 16 at 6426.</p>
</text>
